(b) the variance of the density
  y(1−y) is symmetric about ½, so I(x) + I(1−x) = I(0) and F_γ(x) + F_γ(1−x) = 1 ok
  numerically: ∫₀¹ 2x(1−x)·e^{−γx(1−x)}F_γ/(x(1−x)) dx = J(γ) = ∫₀¹e^{−γx(1−x)}dx ok
  J(γ) = 1 − γ/6 + γ²/60 + O(γ³) (the integral of the expanded exponential) ok
  QTLSim.sojourn_mass(γ) = 1 − γ/6 + γ²/60 − γ³/840 for small γ (to 1e-10 at γ = 0.01) ok
  QTLSim.sojourn_mass(γ) ≈ (2/γ)(1 + 2/γ + 12/γ² + 120/γ³) for large γ (to 1e-6 at γ = 400, 1e4) ok

